# BuildKit uses <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile when the build context is the repo root.
# UNTESTED (no Docker on the authoring machine). Keep secrets, local state and build output out of the context.
**/node_modules
**/.next*
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.git
.github
.local
.vendor
.spike
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env.local
Collara Website
docs
daml/**/.daml
